  "details": "I just banned one of my friends from the group to test the feature.\n\nI'm looking all over the website and see no way to unban them.\n\nAccording to my friend, it doesn't even say which group they were banned from (he's in multiple groups already).\n\nAccording to role permissions, there is a permission to \"view and edit bans\". As the owner of the group, I am supposed to automatically have all permissions.\n\nI see nor can edit no such list.",
